<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="uz">
<head>
<meta charset="UTF-8">
<meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
<title>Okean</title>
<style>
  *{margin:0;padding:0;box-sizing:border-box;font-family:Arial,sans-serif}
  body{background:linear-gradient(180deg,#0077b6,#00b4d8,#90e0ef);min-height:100vh;color:white;text-align:center;padding:40px 20px}
  h1{font-size:52px;letter-spacing:4px}
  p{font-size:18px;margin-top:12px;opacity:0.95}
  .box{background:rgba(255,255,255,0.15);border-radius:20px;padding:24px;margin:30px auto;max-width:500px}
  .box h2{font-size:22px;margin-bottom:10px}
  .btn{display:inline-block;margin-top:25px;background:white;color:#0077b6;padding:14px 28px;border-radius:30px;font-weight:bold;text-decoration:none}
</style>
</head>
<body>
  <h1>OKEAN</h1>
  <p>Okeanga xush kelibsiz</p>

  <div class="box">
    <h2>Okean nima?</h2>
    <p>Bu yerda okean kabi keng, tinch va chuqur fikrlar bo'ladi.</p>
  </div>

  <div class="box">
    <h2>Nima topasan?</h2>
    <p>Fikrlar, matnlar va yangi loyihalar.</p>
  </div>

  <a class="btn" href="#">Boshlash</a>
</body>
</html>